.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Give OG Managers one place to see who still needs encouragement across the habits that matter during rollout — without hopping scorecard → health → feedback requests → acknowledgement nudges.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    This is a validation Coach Inbox. Browse outstanding items with the same “Who to show” scopes as Check-ins Health. Real Slack nudges (with employee / manager / both choice) come later if this surface earns its keep.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-2
    %li
      %strong Check-ins
      — incomplete employee or manager side; pending acknowledgements.
    %li
      %strong OGOs
      — open feedback-request responses; recent OGO comments involving people in this view.
    %li
      %strong Goals
      — stale goal confidence; missing goals on working-to-meet assignments/values; missing goals on milestone gaps (from Engagement Health cache).
    %li
      %strong Expectation Alignment
      — unresolved comments on assignments, positions, and abilities (org-wide for this company).
  %p.mb-0
    Use
    %em Show
    /
    %em Hide
    on each sub-section to open item rows independently. Use
    %em Open
    to jump into the existing work page.
    %em Nudge
    opens a Coming soon dialog in this Beta.
